{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_11_level_main_11-08_beg",
  "groupId": "main_11",
  "stageId": "main_11-08",
  "title": "A Life for a Life",
  "storyCode": "11-9",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "75029fd398d3073e1776e88269cf9049ac31a7a51ef110a46fe0c5889d183907",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ailshie!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hold on! I, I'll..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I promised that I'd..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Go, Allerdale."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Vampire is coming. He cannot find you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ailshie is here. I have to—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You have to follow her orders. She will not allow you to deviate."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Y-You can't..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We can. The Duke has ordered us to help you 'complete your mission', but we are not your servants."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do not forget her instructions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do not forget your place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There is only one thing that you must do. Fulfill your duty."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For an instant, Allerdale forgets where she is, and who is with her.\nShe wants to run, towards the fire that is burning away at what little remains of her life.\nJust like that night twenty-six years ago, when she wanted to run towards another fire to stop Parliament's men from taking her father."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That is your sole responsibility."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Allerdale's eyes open wide. The tears in them evaporate before the fire.\nBut she sees a great silhouette is rising in the burning garden.\nIs it the damaged suit of steam armor? The steam armor upon which she placed so many dreams and hopes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Return to the person of interest. Now."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Through so many trials and tribulations, Allerdale had prayed that her great ancestor would descend into the steam armor and help her overcome all challenges.\nNow she sees the ancient armor breathing the flames of hell.\nShe sees the shadow in the fire roar towards her.\nIt is not her hope. She has strayed far from it.\nEven if her ancestor truly returned—\nAllerdale knows it could only be her worst nightmare."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Tell her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I will obey her will, as always."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I, I don't understand, Your Highness..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I thought you were pleased with our hospitality..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You even graced us with your presence at our banquets, did you not? You liked this place!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I will not deny that you have brought me joy, from time to time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I find your petty flattery and exaggerated cordiality adorable."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You must be mistaken! I have no links to the dukes or the resistance! I swear..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Any trouble must be the work of the Cumberland woman! I'll expose her!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sanguinarch... Your Highness... please, I'll give you anything! My collection, my money... take all of it! Just..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What good are those to me, my dear?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You wouldn't kill me, would you? We should hold a wine tasting! You haven't sampled my private reserve yet..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll be alright, won't I, Lt. Colonel Lettou? This is Londinium!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They—the Sarkaz are just here to protect Londinium at the invitation of the Duke of Cavendish? They wouldn't kill an innocent, of course?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Take him to the front."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I tire of the noise. Begin."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "B-Begin what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Run in when you hear the order."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Confirm everyone is dead and you can come back alive."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In... into the fire? A fire that big? N-No! I'll burn to death!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're going to do exactly that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The ancient Sarkaz steps on the Heart of Victoria and raises a finger."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Argh—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He did not see what was chasing him.\nAs the Sarkaz warrior said, he follows the order instinctively, running forward like a man possessed.\nIn the fire, the slightest chance of survival. On his tail, the scent of certain death.\nBut he only takes a few steps before stumbling in confusion."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Blood spurts from his body.\nIt no longer belongs to him. It serves another master now.\nAt its new master's command, it charges forth towards the collapsing manor, towards the raging flames, chewing through the ruins, swallowing the rubble, covering the cinders.\nNothing can stop the march of blood, not even fire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He was right, Lettou."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I haven't sampled his private reserve."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We should, shouldn't we?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary Captain",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is it. Wait here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lund, Charlie..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is where you kill us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary Captain",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...How do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Simple."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You never told the workers what you were building for the past two years."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But a factory boss gets a few clues."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I guessed you were close to the final stages, the way you people have been pressing us lately. And that means it's time for those who know too much to die."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary Captain",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You lied to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just getting my affairs in order."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What could lowly workers like us do, after groveling for the past three years?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary Captain",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't you dare try anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary Captain",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You, you and you. Come with me; we'll take a look around."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary Captain",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Keep a close eye on her, Paprika."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Can I have a smoke?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm... okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did you ever consider running?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And anyway, it'd only make trouble for the workers left behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've been thinking about what you'd do to us. Looks like whoever's giving the orders still has something of a heart."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But... what do you mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They said to get rid of us quietly so the workers don't panic, didn't they?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If my life buys a chance for the others to live, then so be it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You think the rest of the old timers you brought here don't get that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't get it..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huff..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How old are you, girl?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Doctor, do you know the story of the Steam Knights?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Yes.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "I've heard of them.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Granny used to build them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It was a point of pride for us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "With our own hands, we built the armor worn by the defenders of Londinium, the ones who defended our home."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I wanted to see the birth of those great things, just like Granny... to take part in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Granny's been through a lot. She saw how Londinium became what it is today. And I can see how disappointed she is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I don't want to give up so soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Must be this drawer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hidden compartment... hidden compartment... ah, here it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Granny's incredible. I'd never know this desk had been altered, if she hadn't told me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is... my badge?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And a notebook?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So you grew up in Columbia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, my grandma raised me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mom and Dad were both mercenaries, but they're dead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why did you become a mercenary, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "To feed myself, and grandma."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sarkaz aren't welcome most places, so I had to be a merc."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What a good girl."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So you agree with the Regent?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You mean with occupying the city?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmm... I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We do what we're paid to do. I didn't know we were going to occupy such a big city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In Columbia, we were helping merchants smuggle goods that they didn't want people to know about, or hunting wild beasts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I can tell you, that was the first time I saw Grimm so excited. He said the Sarkaz would get to live a decent life, if we were successful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Grimm? The smoker?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where's he now? I haven't seen him around in a while."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He's dead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Aren't you sad about that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He always said that death and parting are a normal part of the mercenary life."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Death and parting. All these years of chaos, and the Victorians haven't learned the slightest thing about the Sarkaz."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Catch, girl."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Catherine takes a little thing from her cigarette box and tosses it at Paprika.\nIt is small, soft, made of wool, and bright in color."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is... a finger sleeve..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Grimm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You made it for the old merc, didn't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "His finger hurt because of an old wound, but he couldn't cut the smoking habit. I saw him hide it in his cigarette box."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Guess he didn't want to get it dirty, even though you made it for him to use."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He gave me the box when he left. Payment for smokes, those few months."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He never talked about you, but the moment I saw you, I knew you were the girl he was always thinking about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I... I don't..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't know what he thought about the war."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I know, without hearing it from him... you don't know what war is."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Doctor, I thought about what I was going to say to Granny, before I brought you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I thought I was prepared. We've seen so much in our time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I think I owe her an apology."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "You're family.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "She doesn't need your apology, does she?",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Catherine always looks strict and solemn. People forget that she's just an ordinary woman, who lost her livelihood."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here, Doctor! Granny circled some places on the map."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "They'll be heavily guarded.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Feist",
              "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "Yes, it'll be hard to get close to the depots."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "I hope we get results on the other side.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Feist",
              "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "This information will help, though, even if we can't get close."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I wish I could say goodbye to Granny."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Guess it'll have to wait until next time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's go, Doctor."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A lot of us don't actually know what we're fighting for."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's just, we don't have a place to go. We're not welcome anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The King of Sarkaz promised us a home, a country, a future."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've spent time with you people. I can tell that some of you haven't actually fought before."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What about you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can fight!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Have you killed anyone, girl? And I'm not talking about a villain you can kill without remorse... I mean real people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're just a worker. You haven't killed anyone. Don't talk to me like you know what it means."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You've been in Londinium for a while. You've heard of steam armor, haven't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I heard it's a powerful weapon that hasn't been seen for a long time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes. It's a killing machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I built killing machine after killing machine with these hands right here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't feel ashamed, because those machines were used to defend the land I lived on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_648_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What about you, girl? Do you know what your weapon is for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
